### macOS ###
# .DS_Store is a hidden file automatically created by macOS Finder on every folder you open.
# It stores folder display settings (icon positions, view preferences, etc.) and is
# 100% machine-specific. It should NEVER be committed — it pollutes the repo for Windows/Linux
# collaborators and leaks local folder structure metadata.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

